                        <ol class="text-blue-700 space-y-1 list-decimal list-inside">
                            <li>Wire the circuit according to the schematic</li>
                            <li>Program button 1 to cycle through LED colors</li>
                            <li>Program button 2 to create a blinking pattern</li>
